WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.200
Allah chose Ibrahim as a prophet. He told the people, Worship only the One Allah! Do not worship idols!

2
00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:11.752
But the people worshipped many stone statues, treating them as gods.

3
00:00:12.152 --> 00:00:17.720
Ibrahim smashed the small idols, leaving only the biggest one, and hung the axe around its neck.

4
00:00:18.120 --> 00:00:23.880
The people were furious. They shouted, Burn him! And they piled up a mountain of firewood.

5
00:00:24.280 --> 00:00:27.880
The fierce fire blazed, its flames reaching the sky.

6
00:00:28.280 --> 00:00:35.000
Allah said, O fire, be cool and safe for Ibrahim! And the flames turned into gentle light.

7
00:00:35.400 --> 00:00:41.832
Ibrahim walked out unharmed. Remember: trust Allah with all your heart, and He will protect you.
